	(text "+7V5_ZK: the Melzi's Z and K drivers (their 12 V trace cut).\nSet 7.2-7.5 V today. The A4982 wants VBB >= 8 V:\n9 V for margin (motor heat is Vref, not the supply)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ba7f98b5-f8f7-4f38-a277-e793b1db5d14")
	)
	(text "+5V_LED: the UI matrix, the lamp, the\nindockator (and the USB hub). Today the\nLEDs run from a Pi USB port."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 82.55 0)
		(effects
